u0027A-Varargs\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Varargs"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-10T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"70f40bfb42aa8a2447af3472e3ae1c610a7b52d4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Main.java: Document internal invariants with assertions","messageBody":"Main relies on valid task indexes, non-null task entries, and successful\ntask insertion when handling commands and displaying messages.\n\nAdd assertions at these internal boundaries to detect broken assumptions\nduring development. User input validation remains exception-based because\nassertions can be disabled at runtime\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":17,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"0b239108e04b1fb58816f942a2e277a16f36d415","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Main.java: Restore deadline task insertion","messageBody":"The deadline command cannot compile because stray text follows the task\\ninsertion statement. This blocks both the application and quality checks.\\n\\nRemove the stray text so adding a deadline again performs the intended\\ninsertion before its assertion is evaluated.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"3130cdd461dd7e2f1034230d7ac6e80673f9e240","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Main.java: Name command parsing rules","messageBody":"Command parsing repeats delimiters and relies on numeric offsets tied to\\ntheir lengths. Those relationships are difficult to verify when the\\ncommand syntax changes.\\n\\nName the delimiters and maximum command parts, and derive substring\\noffsets from delimiter lengths. This keeps the parsing rules explicit and\\nprevents the offsets from drifting away from their delimiters.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":13,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"9388f7bba9a4b57d50ca08b4beffb1e13bdf4610","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Todo: Centralize completion storage values","messageBody":"Each task subtype translates its completion state to the same string values\\nwhen it is saved. Duplicating that representation obscures the storage\\ncontract and risks inconsistent output.\\n\\nMove the translation and its named values into Todo so every subtype uses\\none documented representation for its completion state.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":15,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"ba127b38922edaf9701e9083a4a785fef996bca9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Main.java: Catch only expected failures","messageBody":"Command handling and task saving catch every exception, which can hide\\nprogramming errors as ordinary user or storage failures.\\n\\nCatch only invalid command values, invalid date-time input, and I/O errors.\\nUnexpected defects can now surface for diagnosis while expected failures\\nretain their existing user-facing behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":4,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"670ea06541a0e3047013944633f7f67d2eefe2e0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Main.java: Name interface layout values","messageBody":"Main.java uses bare values for window dimensions, component spacing, and\\nmessage widths. A reader has to infer each value\u0027s layout role from its\\nuse site.\\n\\nReplace these literals with purpose-specific constants so layout decisions\\nare visible at the class level and can be changed consistently.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":17,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"0e0a469598644ce71f0ff49aad483f420f14734a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Todo: Name date-time display formats","messageBody":"Todo creates date-time formatters inside its formatting methods. The format\\nstrings do not describe their distinct roles, and recreating the formatters\\nobscures that they are fixed application rules.\\n\\nDefine named reusable formatters for event and general user-facing dates so\\nthe display formats are explicit at the class level.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"14b1094dc47ec4f1e7c7e4d82a65dcebc61fa5f4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Storage: Report directory creation failures","messageBody":"Storage looks up the parent directory repeatedly and ignores the result of\\nmkdirs. A directory-creation failure is therefore not represented at the\\npoint where it occurs.\\n\\nUse Files.createDirectories with one named parent directory. The method now\\neither establishes the required directory or propagates its documented I/O\\nfailure to the caller.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":4,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"14429a2866e741373f807a0d565b924b1b02a48d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":13,"deletions":13}}},{"hash":"60612956a76de2896014617f44a180801206f308","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from of89p/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Main.java: Document internal invariants with assertions","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"23899ebb1c93a5db0bc5e172e8d9bb77c362f7c8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"255dbbf184616b65ecee7bc2ebd84382165f2f82","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e95a97c7210ea07a5bfb1382add154520938429d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from of89p/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Branch a code quality","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"3e61298cd138a7729a508947d17aa7e47da197d4","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c12232a78ce19419b6284df782db5d4104c97cb7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #4 from of89p/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Branch a streams","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e53a284ee688f180a3f637ed7c184756ea8f601f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add schedule","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":100,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"0c3bcacb5fa4441604f8a0d4d64949dadb4abfce","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027extension\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["BCD-Extension"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"of89p":{"java":886,"md":2,"fxml":0,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":22,"txt":0}},"authorContributionVariance":{"of89p":49915.707},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"of89p":"CS2103T-F12-2 TEO ..ENCE"}}
